      "title": "Note: Usage",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Size\nOutput size comes from the ResolutionSelector (width/height). Pick megapixels + an aspect ratio and it works out the exact size (rounded to a multiple). This template is set to 2 MP at 2:3, then runs a **2x lanczos upscale** after generation.\n\n## Parameters\n- prompt: what to generate.\n- negative_prompt: unused while cfg is 1.\n- cfg: keep **1** for the turbo path. Raise it only if you actually use a negative prompt.\n- steps: **8** with the 8-step turbo DMD LoRA. No need to push higher.\n- sampler euler_ancestral, scheduler simple."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Size\nOutput size comes from the ResolutionSelector (width/height). Pick megapixels + an aspect ratio and it works out the exact size (rounded to a multiple). This template is set to 2 MP at 2:3, then runs a **2x lanczos upscale** after generation.\n\n## Parameters\n- prompt: what to generate.\n- negative_prompt: unused while cfg is 1.\n- cfg: keep **1** for the turbo path. Raise it only if you actually use a negative prompt.\n- steps: **8** with the 8-step turbo DMD LoRA. No need to push higher.\n- sampler euler_ancestral, scheduler simple."
      },
